      "__id__": 471
    },
    "_lineHeight": 55,
    "_string": "6 or more scattered   <img src = '13' height=50 offset=0/>  during the base game will award the sum of the values displayed on  <img src = '13' height=50 offset=-5/>  and the Feature Selection.\nIf at least 1 position does not contain <Sprite=11>, then the Feature Selection offers the choice of the Free Games Bonus or the Top Up Bonus.\n<img src = '13' height=50 offset=-5/>  and <img src = '11' height=50 offset=-5/> do not appear during the Free Games Bonus.\n",
